  <h2 id="parents">What to tell a worried family</h2>

  <p>
    A worried parent rarely calms down because someone tells them "don't worry." They calm down when the
    real numbers, milestones, and a genuine backup plan are on the table, especially once they understand
    the low-income years are structural to the profession, not a sign their child is failing.
  </p>

  <div class="comparison-grid">
